{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Zariski景"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Zariski 景"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Zariski 景是"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"的范畴上配备 “单位分解” 给出的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck 拓扑"}},{"Plain":".\n仿射概形的单位分解, 是对应的环中生成单位理想的一族元素.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $k$ 为交换环, 记 $\\mathsf{Alg}_k$ 为 $k$-代数的范畴; 对于 $A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_k$ 记对偶范畴中相应的对象为 $\\operatorname{Spec} A$.</p>\n<p>定义 $k$ 上的 <strong>Zariski 景</strong>为 $\\mathsf{Alg}_k^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 配备如下 "},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck 拓扑"}},{"Plain":": $\\operatorname{Spec} A$ 的覆盖是一族态射\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Spec} A[a_i^{-1}] \\to \\operatorname{Spec} A,\r\n$$\n满足 $1\\in (a_1,\\cdots,a_n)$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>结构层</h3>\n<p>Zariski 景上有典范的结构"},{"Local":{"url":"层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":", 它是局部环层.</p>\n"}]}}